{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿﻿﻿﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤璃果です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZDJA1JSZAQVV8F7BEDX2YQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろうのポーズ☆*。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Veneu101さんに代打で出演させて頂いたときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代打は初めてでお話を聞いた時から毎日心がドキドキしていたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しくて新鮮な時間を過ごせました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで自分が助けてもらった分、\nグループに恩返しが出来るよう、これからの時間も大事に過ごしていきたいな〜🌞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のミーグリもどうも有難うございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"33枚目シングル初でとても楽しかったです☺︎︎︎︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZDJB3Q2BHSHWG60X5AEYKW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">猫さんパジャマ🐈‍⬛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZDJC5SVPWPEFFNJ4TJGQMK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n生誕Tシャツも着ました！みんながお誕生日のお祝いをしてくれてとっても嬉しかったです🤍有難う〜〜！！\nHappy！！\nやっぱりこのTシャツ可愛い…💠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カチューシャつけたり、ポニーテールもしたよ〜　　　　今日から受付が始まったのでまたお待ちしてますね‪‪☺︎︎︎︎　<https://fortunemusic.jp/nogizaka_202308/>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はミーグリと、\nらじらー！サンデーもあるので\n是非お聞きください👂🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくちゃんと、さくたんが来てくれます🍓🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 9月末あたりから気温が落ち着くみたいで、秋が楽しみです🍁\n紅葉や秋の空たくさん楽しみだな〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山カメラで写真も撮りたいな〜\nみんなが沢山カメラの情報教えてくれて嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHZDJD5NP2BDDYX9QKPB6N4P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n明日はいちごの日だ！！15日だから🍓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#191 りか"}],"source":"archive"}